    <guid isPermaLink="false">6847d09eb23ed76e6047d7dc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2025 06:37:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新加坡组屋政策的核心，是为</span><strong><span>广大中低收入群体</span></strong><span>，提供一个能</span><strong><span>增值的资产。</span></strong><span>（不仅仅是居住和廉住）</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是</span><strong><span>中低收入家庭「</span></strong><span>财富原始积累」的途径。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也是他们「参与社会分配」和「</span><strong><span>向上流动</span></strong><span>」的基础。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然，也是他们退休的保障。</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>打算建一个微信交流群，有兴趣进群的朋友可加我微信liuduid，备注“听友进群”即可。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>「延伸阅读」</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ma3LLn3_-yAuc4YiGC5sNw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ma3LLn3_-yAuc4YiGC5sNw"><span>新加坡这套住房模式，凭啥让80%的人“躺赢”？</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqi44b0XbGcgjCHfpBTSZE7HCVlH.png"></figure>]]></description>
